Falsifies `jh7110_clock_and_reset::verification::the_pmic_bus_plan_is_never_empty_and_ungates_before_it_releases`.

The defect: the fallback to the constant plan is skipped, so a bus whose specifiers are all
unusable is reported as `from_tree` with an empty plan and the PMIC bus is never brought up.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(!bus.plan().is_empty())`.

